        "subject": "=[Action needed] Shortlist {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.candidateName }} - {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.jobTitle }} ({{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.matchScore }}/100)",
        "message": "=AI Candidate Screening Report - ACTION NEEDED\n\nCandidate: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.candidateName }}\nEmail: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.candidateEmail }}\nJob: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.jobTitle }} ({{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.jobId }})\nRequired experience: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.requiredExperience }}\nCandidate experience (est. years): {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.candidateExperienceYears }}\nOverall match score: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.matchScore }}/100\nReview category: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.reviewStatus }}\n\nScore breakdown:\n{{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.scoreBreakdownText }}\n\nSkills: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.skills }}\nMatching skills: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.matchingSkills }}\nMissing or not demonstrated requirements: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.missingOrUnverified }}\n\nExperience evidence: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.experienceEvidence }}\nProject evidence: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.projectEvidence }}\n\nSummary: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.reviewSummary }}\nQuestions for recruiter: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.recruiterQuestions }}\n\nResume file: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.resumeFileName }}\nApplication ID: {{ $('Parse Analysis and Calculate Score').first().json.applicationId }}\nFull report (see the 'Shortlisted' tab): https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit\n\nNEXT STEP: Review the original resume, then choose below.\n- Approve: the candidate is marked Shortlisted and receives a shortlist email automatically.\n- Decline: the candidate is marked Not Shortlisted and NO email is sent.\n\nIMPORTANT: This is AI-generated decision support, not a hiring decision. Final hiring decisions must remain with a human reviewer.",
